  "short_name": "Eigen",
  "description": "Eigen is a self-hosted alternative to Google Workspace: mail, drive, docs, sheets, slides, drawings, stickies, calendar, contacts and chat. Syncs with your own apps over IMAP, SMTP, CalDAV, CardDAV and WebDAV. Opens and saves Word, Excel and PowerPoint files. You control your data.",
